  "body": "Network Error Logging spec https://w3c.github.io/network-error-logging/ is using the IP address of responses.\r\n```\r\nreceived IP address\r\n    the IP address of the server that the user agent received response from\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe IP address of responses must be explicitly exposed in the Fetch spec.\r\n\r\nCC: @jyasskin , @annevk ",
